        <mxCell id="c2" value="Desktop + mobile | Editable text, controls and layout. Icons / portraits are separate image objects. HTML interactions and validation do not run in draw.io. Main pages, account subpages, verification stages, administrator sections, dialogs and representative empty/error/loading states are included. Double-click text to edit. Ungroup a screen to move individual elements. Linked navigation can open the matching diagram page." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=16;fontColor=#6E6E80;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
